00:15:45,859 --> 00:15:50,979
The BSA guidelines for advancement requirements represent the minimum standards for ranks and

239
00:15:50,979 --> 00:15:51,500
merit badges.

240
00:15:51,500 --> 00:15:55,520
The troops' leaders set the final standards,

241
00:15:57,680 --> 00:15:58,680
True or false.

