00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:00,640
You got that one too right.

243
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:01,200
I hope

244
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:02,960
That's absolutely false.

245
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:10,400
We know that the advancement requirements are written in stone and that we cannot subtract

246
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:12,500
